   "source": [
    "## SI-C for MFA data preparation, case study O'ahu"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90cf9ad5-17e9-466e-9fb5-42a3d3af9338",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "All pre-data handling before inserting into SI-C_calculations is described here. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "f6867a4b-1941-419f-b427-a7a057a55cb1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd \n",
    "import numpy as np"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9bd0b2a-1a5f-4055-9a96-6ae5df709e5c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Imports and Exports"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eebf96aa-4d2e-456a-8b54-fcd623ae33c0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 1) Available Data for Oahu  \n",
    "Different FAF frameworks are used:  (insert overview table)  \n",
    "\n",
    "There are three different types of trade (called trade type in the data base): \n",
    "| No. | Description                                                                                   |\n",
    "|-----|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n",
    "|  1  | Domestic flows (freight shipments moved from US domestic origins to US domestic destinations) |\n",
    "|  2  | Import flows (freight shipments moved from foreign origins to US domestic destinations)       |\n",
    "|  3  | Export flows (freight shipments moved from US domestic origins to foreign destinations)       |\n",
    "\n",
    "Because of the definitions given in the table: \n",
    "* domestic flows could be imports or exports to / from Hawaii.\n",
    "* import flows could be imports or exports to / from Hawaii.\n",
    "* export flows could be exports or imports from / to Hawaii.  \n",
    "→ it is necessary to look at the fr_orig, dms_origst, dms_destst and fr_dest information \n",
    "\n",
    "There are different types of foreign FAF zones:\n",
    "| Numeric Label | Description       |\n",
    "|---------------|-------------------|\n",
    "|      801      | Canada            |\n",
    "|      802      | Mexico            |\n",
    "|      803      | Rest of Americas  |\n",
    "|      804      | Europe            |\n",
    "|      805      | Africa            |\n",
    "|      806      | SW & Central Asia |\n",
    "|      807      | Eastern Asia      |\n",
    "|      808      | SE Asia & Oceania |\n",
    "\n",
    "And for Hawaii / Oahu flows, only two domestic zones are relevant:\n",
    "* 151: Honolulu HI\n",
    "* 159: Rest of HI\n",
    "\n",
    "##### 1.0) General Method\n",
    "Different kind of flows are defined to find out what is being exported or imported from / to Oahu / Hawaii.  \n",
    "\n",
    "__COUNTY DATA: OAHU__\n",
    "* NaN > Oahu > US OR Rest of HI > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Oahu. Source = Oahu, Target = US mainland or Rest of HI (Rest of Hawaii)\n",
    "* NaN > Oahu > US OR Rest of HI > RoW\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Oahu. Source = Oahu, Target = US mainland or Rest of HI\n",
    "* NaN > Oahu > Oahu > RoW\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Oahu. Source = Oahu, Target = RoW\n",
    "    \n",
    "* RoW > US OR Rest of HI > Oahu > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Oahu. Source = US mainland or Rest of HI, Target = Oahu\n",
    "* NaN > US OR Rest of HI > Oahu > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Oahu. Source = US mainland or Rest of HI, Target = Oahu\n",
    "* RoW > Oahu > Oahu > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Oahu. Source = RoW, Target = Oahu\n",
    " \n",
    "\n",
    "* (NaN > Oahu > Rest of HI > RoW)\n",
    "  * (This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Oahu. Source = Oahu, Target = Rest of HI)\n",
    "* (RoW > US > Oahu > NaN)\n",
    "  * (This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Oahu. Source = US mainland, Target = Oahu)\n",
    " \n",
    "__STATE DATA: HAWAII__  \n",
    "* NaN > Hawaii > US > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Hawaii. Source = Hawaii, Target = US mainland\n",
    "* NaN > Hawaii > US > RoW\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Hawaii. Source = Hawaii, Target = US mainland\n",
    "* NaN > Hawaii > Hawaii > RoW\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Export__ from Hawaii. Source = Hawaii, Target = RoW (Rest of World)\n",
    "* RoW > Hawaii > Hawaii > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Hawaii. Source = RoW, Target = Hawaii\n",
    "* NaN > US > Hawaii > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Hawaii. Source = US mainland, Target = Hawaii\n",
    "* RoW > US > Hawaii > NaN\n",
    "  * This flow is considered as an __Import__ to Hawaii. Source = US mainland, Target = Hawaii\n",
    "\n",
    "##### 1.1) 2013-2017  \n",
    "For this time period, the regional (county-level) FAF4.5.1 is used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "f405ad10-490f-4e33-a9e5-13f6dd1185ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "years = [2013, 2014, 2015, 2016, 2017]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "1cd76465-816e-4254-8dc1-09a4036726a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#sctg2_mapping = \"ODYM-master/new_model/FAF_mapping.xlsx\" path to sctg2 mapping\n",
    "FAF4_sctg2 = pd.read_excel(\"“[insert_your_path_here]/SI-B.xlsx\", sheet_name = \"FAF4\")\n",
    "# Dictionary for description \n",
    "desc_map = FAF4_sctg2.set_index(\"Code\")[\"Commodity Description\"]\n",
    "mat_map = FAF4_sctg2.set_index(\"Code\")[\"Material\"]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9545eb96-707e-4eea-9cae-24cf1236e4da",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Download link to FAF4.5.1: https://www.bts.gov/faf"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "18cc20b5-82a7-4314-a9c9-ea3d53118078",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def process_MFA(year):\n",
    "    file_path = f\"[insert_your_path_here]\FAF4.5.1_{year}.csv\"\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(file_path)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Remove columns 11-14 (0-based index, so it's columns 10-13)\n",
    "    df = df.drop(df.columns[10:14], axis=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Filter for rows where dms_orig or dms_dest is 151 (Honolulu)\n",
    "    origin151 = df[df['dms_orig'] == 151]\n",
    "    dest151 = df[(df['dms_dest'] == 151) & (df['dms_orig'] != 151)]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Combine the filtered datasets\n",
    "    Oahu = pd.concat([origin151, dest151], ignore_index=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Python reads some columns not as numbers\n",
    "    Oahu['dms_orig'] = pd.to_numeric(Oahu['dms_orig'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "    Oahu['dms_dest'] = pd.to_numeric(Oahu['dms_dest'], errors='coerce')\n",
    "    Oahu['fr_dest'] = Oahu['fr_dest'].fillna(-1).astype(int)  # Replace NaN with -1, then convert to int\n",
    "    Oahu['fr_orig'] = Oahu['fr_orig'].fillna(-1).astype(int)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Mapping function for locations\n",
    "    def map_location(value):\n",
    "        if value == -1:  # Skip processing if value is -1\n",
    "            return -1\n",
    "        if value == 151:\n",
    "            return \"Honolulu\"\n",
    "        elif value == 159:\n",
    "            return \"Imports from Rest of HI\"\n",
    "        elif 801 <= value <= 808:\n",
    "            return {\n",
    "                801: \"Imports from Canada\",\n",
    "                802: \"Imports from Mexico\",\n",
    "                803: \"Imports from Rest of Americas\",\n",
    "                804: \"Imports from Europe\",\n",
    "                805: \"Imports from Africa\",\n",
    "                806: \"Imports from SW & Central Asia\",\n",
    "                807: \"Imports from Eastern Asia\",\n",
    "                808: \"Imports from SE Asia & Oceania\"\n",
    "            }.get(value, value)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            return \"Imports from US mainland\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Oahu['dms_orig'] = Oahu['dms_orig'].apply(map_location)\n",
    "    Oahu['fr_orig'] = Oahu['fr_orig'].apply(map_location)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def map_location(value):\n",
    "        if value == -1:  # Skip processing if value is -1\n",
    "            return -1\n",
    "        if value == 151:\n",
    "            return \"Honolulu\"\n",
    "        elif value == 159:\n",
    "            return \"Exports to Rest of HI\"\n",
    "        elif 801 <= value <= 808:\n",
    "            return {\n",
    "                801: \"Exports to Canada\",\n",
    "                802: \"Exports to Mexico\",\n",
    "                803: \"Exports to Rest of Americas\",\n",
    "                804: \"Exports to Europe\",\n",
    "                805: \"Exports to Africa\",\n",
    "                806: \"Exports to SW & Central Asia\",\n",
    "                807: \"Exports to Eastern Asia\",\n",
    "                808: \"Exports to SE Asia & Oceania\"\n",
    "            }.get(value, value)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            return \"Exports to US mainland\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    Oahu['dms_dest'] = Oahu['dms_dest'].apply(map_location)\n",
    "    Oahu['fr_dest'] = Oahu['fr_dest'].apply(map_location)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Define filtering options\n",
    "    part1 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] == -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] == \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] != \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] == -1)].drop(columns=['fr_orig', 'fr_dest']).rename(columns={'dms_orig': 'Source', 'dms_dest': 'Target'})\n",
    "    part2 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] == -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] == \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] != \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] != -1)].drop(columns=['fr_orig', 'fr_dest']).rename(columns={'dms_orig': 'Source', 'dms_dest': 'Target'})\n",
    "    part3 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] == -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] == \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] == \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] != -1)].drop(columns=['fr_orig', 'dms_orig']).rename(columns={'dms_dest': 'Source', 'fr_dest': 'Target'})\n",
    "    part4 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] != -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] != \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] == \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] == -1)].drop(columns=['fr_orig', 'fr_dest']).rename(columns={'dms_orig': 'Source', 'dms_dest': 'Target'})\n",
    "    part5 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] == -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] != \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] == \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] == -1)].drop(columns=['fr_orig', 'fr_dest']).rename(columns={'dms_orig': 'Source', 'dms_dest': 'Target'})\n",
    "    part6 = Oahu[(Oahu['fr_orig'] != -1) & (Oahu['dms_orig'] == \"Honolulu\")  & (Oahu['dms_dest'] == \"Honolulu\") & (Oahu['fr_dest'] == -1)].drop(columns=['dms_dest', 'fr_dest']).rename(columns={'fr_orig': 'Source', 'dms_orig': 'Target'})\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Combine all parts\n",
    "    df_final = pd.concat([part1, part2, part3, part4, part5, part6], ignore_index=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Rename columns\n",
    "    df_final.columns = [\"Source\", \"Target\", \"fr_inmode\", \"dms_mode\", \"fr_outmode\", \"sctg2\", \"trade_type\", \"Tons\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Map SCTG product codes to product names\n",
    "    df_final[\"Commodity Description\"] = df_final[\"sctg2\"].map(desc_map)\n",
    "    df_final[\"Material\"] = df_final[\"sctg2\"].map(mat_map)\n",
    "\n",
    "    df_final = df_final.rename(columns={\"Source\": \"Origin\", \"Target\": \"Destination\"})\n",
    "    df_final['Source'] = np.where(df_final[\"Origin\"].str.contains(\"Imports\", case=False, na=False), \"Imports\", \"NAS\")\n",
    "    df_final['Target'] = np.where(df_final[\"Destination\"].str.contains(\"Exports\", case=False, na=False), \"Exports\", \"DMI\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # add year column for comparison later\n",
    "    df_final['Year'] = year\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Save results\n",
    "    output_file = f\"Oahu_MFA{year}.xlsx\"\n",
    "    df_final.to_excel(output_file, index=False)\n",
    "    print(f\"Processed {year} and saved to {output_file}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "a2853bdf-d58f-4f02-b9aa-7617ac2f6d5a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Processed 2013 and saved to Oahu_MFA2013.xlsx\n",
      "Processed 2014 and saved to Oahu_MFA2014.xlsx\n",
      "Processed 2015 and saved to Oahu_MFA2015.xlsx\n",
      "Processed 2016 and saved to Oahu_MFA2016.xlsx\n",
      "Processed 2017 and saved to Oahu_MFA2017.xlsx\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "for year in years:\n",
    "    process_MFA(year)"
   ]
  },
