   "source": [
    "### Domestic Extraction"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f464659f-6379-4862-88ad-a532b17b6296",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 1) Agricultural Production  \n",
    "Due to data scarcity, often caused by competition issues, there is only limited information on agricultural production in Oahu and Hawaii.\n",
    "To tackle this challenge, background information from Loke & Leung 2013 is used. The authors investigated the food supply of Hawaii and evaluated insights that are used in this work to estimate agricultural production in Oahu.\n",
    "\n",
    "Background information:\n",
    "__Domestic Extraction = Imports - Domestic Consumption__\n",
    "with\n",
    "__Domestic Consumption = population * mean consumption per capita__\n",
    "\n",
    "* import data is available\n",
    "* population data is available, as well as visitor-adjusted population data\n",
    "\n",
    "As this work only aims to address food as a total material category, no disaggregation of food groups is necessary.\n",
    "\n",
    "According to Loke & Leung, the mean per capita consumption of food in Hawaii (year 2010) is __657.9 kg__.\n",
    "\n",
    "Also, there is no commercial dairy production on Oahu.\n",
    "\n",
    "__FINAL FORMULA__:  \n",
    "\n",
    "__Domestic Extraction + Imports = Domestic Consumption + Exports + Food waste__  \n",
    "__Domestic Extraction = Domestic Consumption + Exports + Food waste - Imports__  "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b9749ca3-1bc2-4b7e-bfb7-cb8c724030ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
